  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "3. Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "4. Add the chicken wings and cook until browned on all sides, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "5. Add the lemon juice, confit, salt, and pepper to the skillet.",
    "6. Stir to combine and bring the sauce to a simmer.",
    "7. Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10-15 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "8. Stir in the chopped parsley.",
    "9. Serve hot and enjoy!"
